{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごっき〜\n佐々木琴子です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チョコレートにハマってます\nバレンタインあたりからずっと、ずーっと\n普通のミルクチョコが好き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kotoko.sasaki/img/blog/kotoko.sasaki/img/2015/03/07/2518313/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、\"おおきく振りかぶって\"を観始めたよ〜\n今、夏の大会編の9話まで観ました\n田島くんんん\n田島くんんんんんん\n田島悠一郎くんんんんんんんんん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kotoko.sasaki/img/blog/kotoko.sasaki/img/2015/03/07/2518313/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえばこの間、美容院に行ってきました\n久しぶりだったーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kotoko.sasaki/img/blog/kotoko.sasaki/img/2015/03/07/2518313/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カットとトリートメントをしてもらいました\nすぅあらっすぅあらっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヾ(*´∀｀*)ノ"}],"source":"archive"}